  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A hidden weapon is a deadly implement in your hands.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dex 17, Quick Draw, Sleight of Hand 5 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you can draw a light weapon, as a free action you can make a Sleight of Hand check with a bonus equal to your mythic tier, opposed by the Perception check of your target. If you win this opposed check, you treat the target as flat-footed against this attack.</p>\n<p>You can use this feat a number of times in each combat equal to your mythic tier, though the DC increases by 2 for each use after the first and you cannot use it more than once per round against a given opponent. You may use it more than once per round if you use it against different opponents; however, the DC for each Sleight of Hand check increases by 5 for each Flick of the Wrist attack you make after the first check in each round.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc155\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
